# Witness: a measurement the log carries and the register does not declare

The one direction a rule written the obvious way round misses. `host-call` is measured on both
lanes and has no row here, which is how a register quietly becomes a highlight reel: the way to
stop publishing a figure that got worse is to delete its row.

| Measurement | Unit | Candidate | Control | JIT | Native AOT |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `catalog-lookup` | lookup | Resolving a profile by identity | Comparing the same identity | 0.0000 | 0.0000 |
